msgstr "用戶及群組資料庫的來源"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (source), group (connection-$(connection))
#: kuser.kcfg:27
msgid ""
"This option allows you to select where the user/group data stored. Currently "
"three storage backends are supported. <BR><B>Files</B> stores user/group "
"data in traditional /etc/passwd and /etc/group flat files. <BR><B>LDAP</B> "
"stores data in a directory server using the posixAccount and posixGroup "
"object classes; this backend allows the management of Samba users/groups via "
"the sambaSamAccount object class.<BR><B>System</B> provides a read-only "
"access to all users and groups which your installation knows about."
msgstr ""
"此選項讓你選擇在哪裡儲存用戶/群組資料。目前支援三種儲存後端。<BR><B>檔案</B>"
"將用戶/群組資料儲存在傳統的 /etc/passwd 及 /etc/group 檔案。<BR><B>LDAP</B>將"
"資料儲存在目錄伺服器的 posixAccount 及 posixGroup 物件類別中；此後端容許從 "
"sambaSamAccount 物件類別管理 Samba 的用戶/群組。<BR><B>系統</B>提供你的套件安"
"裝認識的所有用戶和群組的唯讀存取。"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (shell), group (connection-$(connection))
#: kuser.kcfg:36
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "Shell"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (shell), group (connection-$(connection))
#: kuser.kcfg:37
msgid ""
"This option allows you to select the shell which will be the default for new "
"users."
msgstr "此選項讓你選取新用戶的預設 shell 。"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (homepath), group (connection-$(connection))
#: kuser.kcfg:40
